output formatting and error handling while isolating cursor-only checks.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Extending formatting to pluralize model counts and align table columns.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Refactoring model resolution to use backend gating and updating tests and config decoding.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Replacing all old model IDs in owned tests with new IDs and adjusting related assertions.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Adding e2e test cases and handling unknown model errors in the CLI.\"}]}"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_6abe236a28153ab3a831432d:rs_01a0f6bbb2d4727f909cf8f61df21008\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"encrypted_content\":\"Q-PaDgF2XJBOLH9zFxfUIvQu8sTF3YUURocieC2P7d4oWlQnwev_9qrooNLtXHJ58jWmMNw-_nnbB54Up463xskAV0EastwT86JF4iiftXxVf2gHiZY-OToAYYAqtI95trWc4UKQGiM8da9af4BKEIp_CyqLmZTVwOJKu4zePTpgY21N53k5FRwfgRvdhVIfbs6AOyYjFOXLMMH6tRvAEqSgjGT2xMf1z3pjrIaXzMK14Ia9h6-8Zq8aW2ae4c8ueGUe2-CTb30QtNEgVULiYY-mJkeIB-Xaa1JnO5gZwoB-gYj6N4n2GFHZOi59EwNpIPWYasVRnZWLROVyn6vLhTYzTjSyg6t3BPsKTLr-e6NqHOllHOAIFFLqLThtMOz3VXyg7wKQj5CVfkiZr4Vr4K1ZNL3c3pDA0etnARo_Uvvu5ouPL0CL0VsHB3VMbOn-9qKb-uuKoLFdaDKU_wViniZo-ShNrk-sl4UU4T4ePC466x-kbz_waO3sMHuYnyX5c5-yJzemXAjo21sSTUrxCZD3dwKnfPRLwWo2uMA_jYNCTTQKtTxk6EjphwNR-DJZxGCVPrEfAQIlTKVXhnh6hEKmzApYJJqGRxdHb9x3ptNQ0U33c80K2Iyr7eH0qUqz2hGQPFNmXDic1WMWt4hNZn70Pp59TpWwuRewWK4FxXXDogD5PIUtjS2SUx_RsNBfJlIgUeNOYQc0TXIyEm3pQ5hKjDMkGovPa0rlMJ16qN8Sw3J9wzdF6Vxli5aQHh5jODB8VIkH6LHiVyns7KfQ7X1EIIs0BHcWf1AQV7UN9GY57lWh77hJQ1FizNrGy4vcRfCKeYwVQ1Nht1Glw_jEFg39DHMBepYfbIZS-WZBONgDHWYtCi_Wg4yK-SC432br__S2DR8nJUPjQujDwE-yuMDq9U_bWkkDrYd5cUnrIlWFxQpl8Y6_awn5rPrk1vgYPf1chgfILg0AEBFBtLtlFSI1hvZsIhKklSxI_1HXlFOL1xSk2XOsfNySUUcM_0C2pNYOSLM0I-eTaj1aUCt_05H1Pk8ohDG1vP09iusACEeu29ZPzM7dYg_cRBiETiUkSigUErGRGiDtjECXVvvO1Cs3t9htpAqksSrPhoDBI2xh0WB8UXeVWaZHO4gTHb0AB_nlIYCTEeFKnn7HPJucdO306j3BV34a5ueFBPTeTY8T-YvrdAYJG-YOR8q8TtoRqE4Qj2Lizt7oN87yR